      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_02_math_05",
      "hash64": "372A572F0C71ECFE",
      "text": "Seguro que os habéis pasado alguna vez por la\\nTienda Pokémon, ¿no? Donde venden todo tipo\\r\\nde objetos relacionados con los Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_02_math_06",
      "hash64": "372A562F0C71EB4B",
      "text": "Tienen muchas cosas útiles, como, por ejemplo,\\nPoké Balls, que se venden por 200 .[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_02_math_07",
      "hash64": "372A552F0C71E998",
      "text": "Muy bien, pues os planteo el siguiente problema.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
